<div class="mw-collapsible-content" style="font-weight:normal; color: inherit;; text-align:start;">
<div class="multilingual"><div class="description bs lang-bs" lang="bs" dir="ltr" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-bs" lang="bs" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>Bosanski</bdi>&#x3a;&#32;</span> Crvena jabuka</div><div class="description cs lang-cs" lang="cs" dir="ltr" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-cs" lang="cs" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>Čeština</bdi>&#x3a;&#32;</span> Červené <a href="https://cs.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jablko" class="extiw" title="cs:Jablko">jablko</a></div><div class="description da lang-da" lang="da" dir="ltr" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-da" lang="da" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>Dansk</bdi>&#x3a;&#32;</span> Et rødt <a href="https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/%C3%A6ble" class="extiw" title="da:æble">æble</a>.</div><div class="description de lang-de" lang="de" dir="ltr" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-de" lang="de" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>Deutsch</bdi>&#x3a;&#32;</span> Ein roter <a href="https://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kulturapfel" class="extiw" title="de:Kulturapfel">Apfel</a></div><div class="description en lang-en" lang="en" dir="ltr" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-en" lang="en" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>English</bdi>&#x3a;&#32;</span> A red apple.</div><div class="description es lang-es" lang="es" dir="ltr" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-es" lang="es" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>Español</bdi>&#x3a;&#32;</span> Una <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/es:manzana" class="extiw" title="w:es:manzana">manzana</a> roja</div><div class="description fr lang-fr" lang="fr" dir="ltr" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-fr" lang="fr" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>Français</bdi>&#x202f;&#x3a;&#32;</span> Une pomme rouge</div><div class="description it lang-it" lang="it" dir="ltr" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-it" lang="it" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>Italiano</bdi>&#x3a;&#32;</span> Una <a href="https://it.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mela" class="extiw" title="it:Mela">mela</a>.</div><div class="description hu lang-hu" lang="hu" dir="ltr" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-hu" lang="hu" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>Magyar</bdi>&#x3a;&#32;</span> Piros alma</div><div class="description nl lang-nl" lang="nl" dir="ltr" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-nl" lang="nl" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>Nederlands</bdi>&#x3a;&#32;</span> rode <a href="https://nl.wikipedia.org/wiki/appel_(vrucht)" class="extiw" title="nl:appel (vrucht)">appel</a></div><div class="description pl lang-pl" lang="pl" dir="ltr" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-pl" lang="pl" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>Polski</bdi>&#x3a;&#32;</span> Czerwone <a href="https://pl.wikipedia.org/wiki/jab%C5%82ko" class="extiw" title="pl:jabłko">jabłko</a></div><div class="description pt lang-pt" lang="pt" dir="ltr" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-pt" lang="pt" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>Português</bdi>&#x3a;&#32;</span> <a href="/wiki/Apple" title="Apple">Maçã vermelha</a>.</div><div class="description ro lang-ro" lang="ro" dir="ltr" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-ro" lang="ro" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>Română</bdi>&#x3a;&#32;</span> Un măr de culoare roșie</div><div class="description fi lang-fi" lang="fi" dir="ltr" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-fi" lang="fi" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>Suomi</bdi>&#x3a;&#32;</span> Punainen omena</div><div class="description be-tarask lang-be-tarask" lang="be-tarask" dir="ltr" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-be-tarask" lang="be-tarask" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>Беларуская (тарашкевіца)</bdi>&#x3a;&#32;</span> Чырвоны <a href="/wiki/Category:Apples" title="Category:Apples">яблык</a>.</div><div class="description mk lang-mk" lang="mk" dir="ltr" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-mk" lang="mk" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>Македонски</bdi>&#x3a;&#32;</span> Црвено <a href="https://mk.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D1%98%D0%B0%D0%B1%D0%BE%D0%BB%D0%BA%D0%BE" class="extiw" title="mk:јаболко">јаболко</a>.</div><div class="description ru lang-ru" lang="ru" dir="ltr" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-ru" lang="ru" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>Русский</bdi>&#x3a;&#32;</span> Красное <a href="/wiki/Category:Apples" title="Category:Apples">яблоко</a></div><div class="description uk lang-uk" lang="uk" dir="ltr" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-uk" lang="uk" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>Українська</bdi>&#x3a;&#32;</span> Червоне <a href="https://uk.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D1%8F%D0%B1%D0%BB%D1%83%D0%BA%D0%BE" class="extiw" title="uk:яблуко">яблуко</a>. <small>(Використано білий папір позаду і над яблуком і фотоспалах).</small></div><div class="description bn lang-bn" lang="bn" dir="ltr" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-bn" lang="bn" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>বাংলা</bdi>&#160;&#x3a;&#32;</span> লাল আপেল।</div><div class="description ko lang-ko" lang="ko" dir="ltr" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-ko" lang="ko" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>한국어</bdi>&#x3a;&#32;</span> 빨간 사과.</div><div class="description ja lang-ja" lang="ja" dir="ltr" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-ja" lang="ja" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>日本語</bdi>&#xff1a;</span> 赤いリンゴ</div><div class="description zh lang-zh" lang="zh" dir="ltr" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-zh" lang="zh" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>中文</bdi>&#xff1a;</span> 红<a href="https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%8B%B9%E6%9E%9C" class="extiw" title="zh:苹果">苹果</a></div><div class="description zh-hant lang-zh-hant" lang="zh-hant" dir="ltr" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-zh-hant" lang="zh-hant" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>中文（繁體）</bdi>&#xff1a;</span> 紅<a href="https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%98%8B%E6%9E%9C" class="extiw" title="zh:蘋果">蘋果</a></div></div>
</div></div>
