<div id="assessments" dir="ltr" lang="en">
<table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="margin:0.5em auto; width: 100%;">
<tbody><tr>
<td>
<table style="width:100%; clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; background-color:var(--background-color-warning-subtle,#faf5e6); color: var(--color-base, #202122); box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0; border-spacing: 8px; border:2px solid #E5D4A1; border-spacing: 2px; margin: auto;" dir="ltr" class="layouttemplate"><tbody><tr><td>
<table style="width:100%;">


<tbody><tr>
<td style="width:40px;text-align:center;" rowspan="2">
<figure class="mw-halign-center" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/wiki/Commons:Picture_of_the_Year/2009" title="Picture of the year"><img alt="Picture of the year" src="https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/59/PODY_candidate.svg/40px-PODY_candidate.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="40" height="30" class="mw-file-element" srcset="https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/59/PODY_candidate.svg/120px-PODY_candidate.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="148" data-file-height="111" /></a><figcaption>Picture of the year</figcaption></figure><span typeof="mw:File"><span title="Featured picture"><img alt="Featured picture" src="https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e7/Cscr-featured.svg/40px-Cscr-featured.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="40" height="38" class="mw-file-element" srcset="https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e7/Cscr-featured.svg/120px-Cscr-featured.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="466" data-file-height="443" /></span></span>
</td>
<td>
</td>
<td style="width:30px;text-align:center;" rowspan="2">
<p><span typeof="mw:File"><span title="Wikimedia Commons"><img alt="Wikimedia Commons" src="https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4a/Commons-logo.svg/40px-Commons-logo.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="30" height="40" class="mw-file-element" srcset="https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4a/Commons-logo.svg/60px-Commons-logo.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="1024" data-file-height="1376" /></span></span><span typeof="mw:File"><span title="Wikipedia"><img alt="Wikipedia" src="https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/80/Wikipedia-logo-v2.svg/40px-Wikipedia-logo-v2.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="30" height="27" class="mw-file-element" srcset="https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/80/Wikipedia-logo-v2.svg/60px-Wikipedia-logo-v2.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="103" data-file-height="94" /></span></span>
</p>
</td></tr>
<tr>
<td>This is a <b>featured picture</b> on Wikimedia Commons (<a href="/wiki/Commons:Featured_pictures" title="Commons:Featured pictures">Featured pictures</a>) and is considered one of the finest images. See its nomination <a href="/wiki/Commons:Featured_picture_candidates/File:Red_Apple.jpg" title="Commons:Featured picture candidates/File:Red Apple.jpg">here</a>.<br /><hr /><span typeof="mw:File"><span><img src="https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e7/Cscr-featured.svg/20px-Cscr-featured.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="19" class="mw-file-element" srcset="https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e7/Cscr-featured.svg/40px-Cscr-featured.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="466" data-file-height="443" /></span></span>&#160;This is a <b>featured picture</b> on the Malay language Wikipedia (<a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ms:Wikipedia:Gambar_pilihan" class="extiw" title="w:ms:Wikipedia:Gambar pilihan">Gambar pilihan</a>) and is considered one of the finest images. See its nomination <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ms:Wikipedia:Calon_gambar_pilihan/Minggu_27_hingga_minggu_52_2013#Minggu_35" class="extiw" title="w:ms:Wikipedia:Calon gambar pilihan/Minggu 27 hingga minggu 52 2013">here</a>.<br /><span typeof="mw:File"><span><img src="https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e7/Cscr-featured.svg/20px-Cscr-featured.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="19" class="mw-file-element" srcset="https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e7/Cscr-featured.svg/40px-Cscr-featured.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="466" data-file-height="443" /></span></span>&#160;This is a <b>featured picture</b> on the Turkish language Wikipedia (<a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/tr:Vikipedi:Se%C3%A7kin_resimler" class="extiw" title="w:tr:Vikipedi:Seçkin resimler">Seçkin resimler</a>) and is considered one of the finest images. See its nomination <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/tr:Vikipedi:Se%C3%A7kin_resim_adaylar%C4%B1/Red_Apple.jpg" class="extiw" title="w:tr:Vikipedi:Seçkin resim adayları/Red Apple.jpg">here</a>.<br />
<hr />
<p>If you have an image of similar quality that can be published under a <a href="/wiki/Commons:Licensing" title="Commons:Licensing">suitable copyright license</a>, be sure to <a href="/wiki/Special:Upload" title="Special:Upload">upload</a> it, <a href="/wiki/Commons:Copyright_tags" title="Commons:Copyright tags">tag</a> it, and <a href="/wiki/Commons:Featured_picture_candidates" title="Commons:Featured picture candidates">nominate it</a>.<br />
</p>
</td></tr></tbody></table>
